:"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"w7O9Sr3hz-qPOogSTDq3pw","review_id":"WyCffejIVau3Kn3ZnK7LSg","date":"2013-03-05T22:03:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9323887825012207,"text_excerpt":"I hadn't been here in years when a friend brought me here the other night to hang out with his pals. This was not the Bourbon Pub that I remember. It was WAY better. I used to hang out here before Katrina. Back in those days, it was a rarity to see women here on a Saturday night and a lot of times they were given dirty looks by the regulars. I totally get it. This is a legit hang out for a lot of people and a bunch of straight women who see it as a novelty to dance with men who have no interest in them romantically can get annoying. These days the Pub seems totally different. Not only are there a bunch of people of all types here, but everyone is super nice and friendly. Downstairs is a m..."},{"business_id":"w7O9Sr3hz-qPOogSTDq3pw","review_id":"TmlvvCbgDJZr2wV9PP6Obw","date":"2018-01-30T05:41:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9288873672485352,"text_excerpt":"This bar is very upbeat and a huge +because it has a fireplace. While my friends and I were out and about on Bourbon Street I needed to pee really bad before we left and ended up in a gay bar! True story They have a huge screen right above the bar playing all kind of music videos everybody having a good time and many drinks customized by the bartender. A big deal breaker for the bathrooms is there is one big main bathroom with multiple stalls for men however the women's bathroom is a one person occupancy only. Bummer for the ladies. It's definitely okay because they make up for it with dancing! There's ample room for dancing and walking as the bar is in the center of the establishment wit..."},{"business_id":"w7O9Sr3hz-qPOogSTDq3pw","review_id":"JvnChYoP8jYMClE2C2MacQ","date":"2018-10-29T05:23:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9254884719848633,"text_excerpt":"This local gay bar had very reasonable pricing on their drinks. They have both an upstairs and downstairs. The upstairs has a balcony that you can sit and watch the craziness unfold on Bourbon Street. They play pretty good music, and for the most part, the bartenders and staff were friendly. A great spot to try out!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"w7O9Sr3hz-qPOogSTDq3pw","photo_id":"D7egscMr6XqtCkmNB-4igQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/D7egscMr6XqtCkmNB-4igQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8900010585784912},{"business_id":"w7O9Sr3hz-qPOogSTDq3pw","photo_id":"PEc-5dysVREetRPT1uK5WA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/PEc-5dysVREetRPT1uK5WA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8843236565589905},{"business_id":"w7O9Sr3hz-qPOogSTDq3pw","photo_id":"5ibdbs4xEIfgarEbbBaBww","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/5ibdbs4xEIfgarEbbBaBww.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8602777719497681}]},"notebook_case":null}
